            "display_dots": true,
            "author_1": "Dr. Adam Rami - MD Hormonal Health Expert - <strong>DOUBLE U.S. BOARD CERTIFIED LONGEVITY SPECIALIST</strong> [stars]",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Title_4_2a80419b-8c44-44c7-a9a3-ebd19d17861b.png",
            "text_1": "<p>\"I highly recommend Magnali for men and women struggling with low energy and wrinkles. Clinical data and my own patient outcomes show that consistent use over 90 days can significantly boost hormonal levels, enhance vitality, and improve longevity health.\"</p>",
            "author_2": "<strong>Christina K</strong> [stars]",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/3_5.webp",
            "text_2": "<p>\"Unlike other online advertisements that fail to impress. this Magneli Protocol stood out to impressively transform my life. 10/10 for me\"</p>",
            "author_3": "<strong>Chris C</strong> [stars]",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/2_5.webp",
            "text_3": "<p>\"Top quality~ boosted my energy , my sex game is strong so higher testosterone, so focused and really good sleep and dreams. wish i got this earlier in my life\"</p>",
            "margin_top": 9,
            "margin_bottom": 9
          }
        },
        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Magnali Protocol represent a breakthrough in longevity health supplementation. <br/></p><p>This scientifically formulated synergistic blend addresses the root causes of aging, not just symptoms. By supporting your body's natural testosterone production pathways, our convenient all-in-one protocol deliver comprehensive, long-term wellness without complicated regimens or questionable substances.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ewadFh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Magnali Fuel:</p><p>Collagen Peptides (hydrolyzed), Inulin (Prebiotic Fiber), Lion’s Mane Extract (10:1), Sunflower Lecithin, Ashwagandha Extract (KSM-66), L-Theanine, Rhodiola Rosea Extract, Magnesium Citrate, Panax Ginseng Extract, Probiotic Blend (Lactobacillus + Bifidobacterium, 1B CFU), Maltodextrin, Acacia Fiber, Natural Flavor (Vanilla or Neutral), Citric Acid, Silicon Dioxide, Erythritol, Hyaluronic Acid, Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid), Stevia Extract (Reb-M), Vitamin B-Complex (B1, B3, B6, B12), Zinc (Picolinate), Black Pepper Extract (Piperine), Biotin</p><p>Magnali Signal:</p><p>Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Betaine, Niacinamide, Panthenol, Ectoin, Phenoxyethanol, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Disodium EDTA, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate</p><p>Magnali X:</p><p>Microcrystalline Cellulose, Trimethylglycine (Betaine), Nicotinamide Riboside, Coenzyme Q10 (Ubiquinol), Apigenin, Magnesium Stearate, Silicon Dioxide, Pyrroloquinoline Quinone, Astaxanthin, Spermidine, Folate (as 5-Methyltetrahydrofolate)</p><p>check_box</p><h2>Third-Party Lab Test Results</h2><p><br/><br/></p><h2>Still have questions?</h2><h2>What exactly is Magnali Fuel?</h2><p>Magnali Fuel is an all-in-one daily powder supplement designed to replace your cluttered supplement cabinet. It combines clinically studied ingredients for focus, energy, calm, skin, gut health, and immunity – all in one clean formula.</p><h2>How do I take it?</h2><p>For Magnali Fuel: Mix one or two scoops (approx. 7-14g) with water or your favorite drink once daily – ideally in the morning. No pills, no hassle.</p><p>For Magnali X: Take 4 capsules orally daily after eating. Consume with water.</p><p>For Magnali Signal: Apply once daily in the evening. After cleansing, apply 3-4 drops to clean, dry skin and spread evenly across the face and neck. </p><h2>How long does one bundle last?</h2><p>One bundle contains about 30 daily servings. That’s about a full month of results – in one bundle.</p><h2>Is it safe?</h2><p>Yes. Magnali Fuel is formulated by experts, lab-tested, and made in GMP-certified facilities. All ingredients are naturally derived and within scientifically backed dosages.</p><h2>Will I actually feel a difference?</h2><p>Most users report noticeable effects within the first 5–7 days: improved focus, steady energy, and reduced brain fog. Skin, gut, and mood benefits become more noticeable within 2–4 weeks.</p><h2>Can I take it with my other supplements or meds?</h2><p>Magnali is designed to reduce your supplement stack, but always consult your doctor if you’re on medication or have health concerns.</p><h2>Is it vegan / gluten-free / non-GMO?</h2><p>Yes – it’s 100% vegan, gluten-free, soy-free, dairy-free and non-GMO.</p><h2>Where is it made?</h2><p>Magnali Fuel is developed in Singapore and manufactured in certified, state-of-the-art facilities under strict international quality control.</p><h2>Can I cancel or return my order?</h2><p>Yes – you’re protected by our 60-day satisfaction guarantee. If you’re not happy, we’ll make it right. Simple.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/products/fuel\">Fuel</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/products/magnali-longevity-lifestyle-blueprint\">Longevity Blueprint</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/pages/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/pages/about-us\">About us</a></li></ul><h2>Sign up and save 10% on your next order!</h2><p>Join our email list for exclusive offers and the latest news.</p><p>EmailSign up</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/policies/contact-information\">Contact information</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/policies/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/policies/refund-policy\">Return and refund policy</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/policies/terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a href=\"https://magnali.com/policies/subscription-policy\">Subscription Policy</a></li></ul><p><em>These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Not a drug. Results may vary.</em></p><p>VELTRION GROUP PTE. LTD., 10 ANSON ROAD #28-18 INTERNATIONAL PLAZA, Singapore 079903, Singapore</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61578629752174\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/magnalifuel/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a></li><li><a href=\"https://tiktok.com/@magnalicom\" target=\"_blank\">TikTok</a></li></ul><h2>Country/region</h2><p>Vietnam (VND ₫)Payment methods</p><ul><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p>© 2026,<a href=\"https://magnali.com/\">Magnali</a></p>",
            "page": "",
